tools.example:
1. Select the subject.
2. Click the adjustment button in the Layers panel and choose Curves - the selection becomes the layer's mask.
3. Lift the midtones; only the subject brightens.

JSX (Action Manager) creates a Curves layer:
var d = new ActionDescriptor();
var r = new ActionReference();
r.putClass(stringIDToTypeID("adjustmentLayer"));
d.putReference(stringIDToTypeID("target"), r);
var t = new ActionDescriptor();
t.putClass(stringIDToTypeID("type"), stringIDToTypeID("curves"));
d.putObject(stringIDToTypeID("using"), stringIDToTypeID("adjustmentLayer"), t);
executeAction(stringIDToTypeID("make"), d, DialogModes.NO);
